Create an image of php project and push on Dockerhub repository.

✅ Step 1: Create a Simple PHP Project
my-php-app/
├── index.php
├── Dockerfile

index.php
<?php
echo "Hello from Dockerized PHP App!";
?>

✅ Step 2: Create a Dockerfile
# Use official PHP image
FROM php:8.2-apache

# Copy PHP code to Apache web root
COPY index.php /var/www/html/

# Expose port 80
EXPOSE 80

✅ Step 3: Build Docker Image
Run in terminal:
cd my-php-app
docker build -t your_dockerhub_username/my-php-app .

✅ Step 4: Login to Docker Hub
docker login

✅ Step 5: Push to Docker Hub
docker push your_dockerhub_username/my-php-app

✅ Step 6: Run the Image (Optional)
docker run -d -p 8080:80 your_dockerhub_username/my-php-app


